Z||000006||GodSend||06-26-2001||03:31 PM||||I have a pretty nice alarm on it (clifford).  I had my Talon broken into even when it was a stelth install.. never bumped in open parking lots.  Kept in the downlow, and they still go everything (and there was a ton in that car).  I was always careful with that baby.  2 nights at my mechanics and pow.  <P>  As far as grills.  I have them, and am in the process of putting them in.  99.9% of the driving is done alone with just me, so UNtill i finish it up im not too worried.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.hypernetcommunications.com/revn.gif"> ||||reg||1
