Z||000009||Monkeyman||06-26-2001||08:13 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by GodSend:<BR><B>Looks like I am almost done, Just waiting for AusFieros consoles so I can install my IDQ 10'... </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>You're gonna use a <B>10 foot</B> sub????  Where the hell are ya gonna put it???  I'll bet it'll be loud.  If you crank it up in Toronto, I'll be able to feel the vibrations down here in Indiana!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>MM<P>||||reg||1
