Z||000012||GodSend||06-27-2001||01:28 AM||||Yeah, A friend had to talk me out of getting the 12 foot sub  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>The paint is called Candy Brandy Wine.  Its really nice, but does not have that yellow tinge to it (must have been the angle the flash reflected off it)...<P>The location of the crossovers is actaully kinda safe because the seat belt guide comes right up next to it with the door closed and protects it pretty well.  I stuck them there as a compromise to routing 5 sets of speaker wires per door into the cabin.  I did not like the idea of leaving them dangling in between the door skins either...<P><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.hypernetcommunications.com/revn.gif"> ||||reg||1
